WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
If you take medication for diabetes, including insulin or oral medications

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
like metformin, the day before your procedure requires some extra attention.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Because you'll be on a clear liquid diet today, your usual medication routine

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
may need to be adjusted to avoid low blood sugar. If you haven't been already

5
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
instructed, please contact your doctor's office or your prescribing physician

6
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
for specific guidance on what to take, what to hold, and when.

7
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Do not adjust your insulin or diabetes medications on your own.

8
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.000
If you experience any symptoms of low blood sugar like shakiness, sweating,

9
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.000
or confusion, treat it promptly and contact them right away.
